    "note": "Chaptered, Public Chapter 773 (signed 2024-04-26); HB 2762 shares one chapter with its twin. Quote 45-2-2204(b)(3) keeps the printed \"(b )(2)\" spacing. Judged single subject: all parts concern firearm and ammunition purchase privacy."
